---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Application Received | Pinnacle Sales" description="Your dealer application is in. Here's what happens next." noindex={true}>
<div class="page-header"><h1>Application Received</h1><p>A Pinnacle Sales rep will call you the same business day — first thing the next business morning if you applied after 3 pm Pacific.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section thanks">

<h2>What happens next</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Check your inbox</strong> — a note confirming when your rep will call is on its way now.</li>
  <li><strong>The call</strong> — same business day. Your rep covers what is open in your market for the brands you checked, what a first display and opening order look like, and how the team supports you after launch.</li>
  <li><strong>Brand deep-dive</strong> — pricing, display programs, training, and next steps for the lines you choose.</li>
</ol>

<p>Want to talk sooner? Call <a href="tel:+14809939224">480-993-9224</a> or email <a href="mailto:marketing@pinnaclesales.biz">marketing@pinnaclesales.biz</a>.</p>

<h2>While you wait</h2>
<ul>
  <li>See what dealers say in our <a href="/dealer-success-stories/">Dealer Success Stories</a></li>
  <li>Get to know the lineup: <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a>, <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a>, <a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a>, <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a>, <a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a>, and <a href="/brands/us-stone-group/">US Stone Group</a></li>
  <li>Read the <a href="/playbook/">Kitchen Dealer Playbook</a> — product deep dives and dealer success stories</li>
</ul>

</div>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  // GA4 conversion — fires ONLY when a real submission stashed context on the form page.
  // Direct visits, refreshes, and bookmarks push nothing (raw is null after removeItem).
  try {
    var raw = sessionStorage.getItem('ps_lead');
    if (!raw) return;
    sessionStorage.removeItem('ps_lead');
    var ctx = JSON.parse(raw);
    // SEOHead defers gtag.js until interaction/5s; wake it now so the queued
    // conversion transmits even if the visitor closes the tab immediately.
    window.dispatchEvent(new Event('mousedown'));
    if (typeof gtag === 'function') {
      gtag('event', 'generate_lead', {
        currency: 'USD',
        value: 1.0,
        form_name: ctx.form || 'dealer-application',
        lead_type: ctx.lead_type || 'unknown',
        source_page: ctx.source || 'unknown'
      });
    }
  } catch (e) {}
})();
</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.thanks h2{margin-top:2rem}
.thanks ul,.thanks ol{line-height:1.9}
</style>
